msgid "$p$ がどれも 2.000 に近くなります。`max error (discrete)` は、どの $N$ でも $10^{-11}$ 以下です。"
msgstr "Every $p$ is close to 2.000. `max error (discrete)` is at most $10^{-11}$ for every $N$."

msgid "**安定条件**（任意）：`./heat1d_serial 64 0.6` を実行し、誤差が非常に大きくなる（計算が壊れる）ことを確かめます。 `./heat1d_serial 64 0.5` では壊れないことも確かめます。"
msgstr "**Stability condition** (optional): Run `./heat1d_serial 64 0.6` and check that the error becomes very large (the computation breaks down). Also check that `./heat1d_serial 64 0.5` does not break down."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "離散解との差が大きいときは、ゴーストセルの値、物理セルの範囲（`Range1D` の上限は含まない）、$x_j$ の式（$+1/2$ と添字のずれ）を順に調べます。 離散解とは合うのに解析解との差が表と違うときは、$\\Delta t$、$n_\\mathrm{steps}$、$t_\\mathrm{end}$ を調べます。"
msgstr "If the difference from the discrete solution is large, check in order the ghost-cell values, the range of the physical cells (the upper limit of `Range1D` is excluded), and the expression for $x_j$ (the $+1/2$ and the index offset). If it agrees with the discrete solution but the difference from the analytical solution differs from the table, check $\\Delta t$, $n_\\mathrm{steps}$, and $t_\\mathrm{end}$."

msgid "次へ進む目安"
msgstr "Criteria for moving on"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "上の 3 と 4 の値が得られたら、{ref}`02. MPI 版 <edu-practice-heat1d-02>` へ進みます。 書き出した `result_N64_serial.txt` などは、MPI 版との比較に使うので残しておきます。"
msgstr "Once you obtain the values in 3 and 4 above, move on to the {ref}`02. MPI version <edu-practice-heat1d-02>`. Keep the files you wrote, such as `result_N64_serial.txt`, because you will use them in the comparison with the MPI version."

